# Hurrying the opening flight (input.c): during it a direction doesn't hit the loop; the first
# button press (any but START and Z) runs it at x3, and later presses do nothing. The debug line,
# top left, shows the segment, frame and speed. Once it has landed, a direction hits the loop
# again (a burst of light)
wait_boot
shot hurry_1_x1
press b
wait 0.3
shot hurry_2_x3
press left
press right
wait 0.3
shot hurry_3_still_x3_no_hit
wait 3.5
shot hurry_4_landed
press left
wait 0.1
shot hurry_5_hit
